OL,3,GNEWSASouthport survivor backs knife    
OL,4,Asales licence                          
OL,6,FA yoga instructor who survived the     
OL,7,FSouthport stabbing attack has said she 
OL,8,Fcannot "sit back" and "hope nothing    
OL,9,Flike this happens again", as she backed
OL,10,Fgovernment plans to require businesses 
OL,11,Fto hold licences to sell knives.       
OL,13,FLeanne Lucas was critically injured    
OL,14,Fwhen she was stabbed as she helped to  
OL,15,Frun a Taylor Swift-themed dance class  
OL,16,Fon 29 July 2024.                       
OL,18,FThe attacker, who murdered three girls 
OL,19,Fand stabbed eight other children and   
OL,20,Ftwo adults, had bought the knife on    
OL,21,FAmazon.                                
